# Composer dev tooling. These are BUILD-TIME only: php-cs-fixer, php-dev-tools and
# header-stamp are how the module is checked against PrestaShop's coding standards, and
# none of them belong in the repository or in the ZIP submitted to Addons — a module ZIP
# containing a vendor/ full of dev tools is a validation finding, not a feature.
/vendor/
/composer.lock

# php-cs-fixer's own cache, machine-local.
/.php-cs-fixer.cache
